    <h1>I build products where regulated finance meets crypto markets.</h1>
    <p class="lead">I&rsquo;m a product manager who ships financial infrastructure in one of the hardest domains there is &mdash; global crypto derivatives, inside the perimeters regulators draw. I ship regulated financial products for retail users on Coinbase Advanced and institutional clients on Coinbase Prime &mdash; and the exchanges behind them. The products I&rsquo;m proudest of didn&rsquo;t exist before we shipped them: the first US-regulated route to global crypto derivatives, the industry&rsquo;s first automated margin calls, and two exchanges built from zero.</p>
