        <div class="slide-fig"><b>T+0</b></div>
        <div class="slide-body">
          <div class="meta"><span class="pill">2025</span><span class="pill">Product</span></div>
          <h3>Capital efficiency and off-exchange settlement</h3>
          <p>Institutions need collateral at the venue to trade with size, but assets sitting on an exchange are assets they no longer control. Copper's ClearLoop lets clients hold assets in MPC custody, trade on the exchange, and settle near real-time. Ethena came in as a day-one launch partner.</p>
          <p class="mine">[Your part — the haircut methodology, and the asset you argued against accepting.]</p>
